---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Demo" description="One grocery basket, three domains: a supermarket in Bengaluru, its warehouse and its milk route, in a synthetic, seeded world." image="og/demo.png">
  <h1>One grocery basket, three domains</h1>
  <p class="lede">The demo follows one supermarket in Bengaluru, the warehouse that supplies it and the dairy route that delivers its milk, through four weeks of June 2026. All of it is synthetic and seeded.</p>

  <aside class="notice" aria-label="Status">
    <p>Being rebuilt on a realistic world from the Domain Explorer project. Each scenario opens here as its post is published.</p>
  </aside>

  <section id="retail">
    <h2>Retail: the shelf</h2>
    <p>The system shows atta in stock, so it never reorders. The shelf has been empty for days, sales drop, and the forecast learns the wrong lesson.</p>
    <p><a href={`${base}retail/`}>Read the retail outline</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="logistics">
    <h2>Logistics: the movement</h2>
    <p>The truck makes its delivery slot. One pallet holds 1 kg packs instead of 5 kg, and the goods receipt books what the shipping notice said.</p>
    <p><a href={`${base}logistics/`}>Read the logistics outline</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="payments">
    <h2>Payments: the money</h2>
    <p>A UPI payment times out at the till. The customer is debited, the shop sees a failure, and the customer is asked to pay again.</p>
    <p><a href={`${base}payments/`}>Read the payments outline</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
